<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Sept car sales fall 10.9 pct vs yr ago.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Sept car sales fall 10.9 pct vs yr ago.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's car and truck sales fell 10.9 percent in September from the same month last year, a closely-watched survey issued by the local subsidiary of General Motors Corp said.</p>
<p>It said vehicle sales for the month totalled 8,890, down from 9,980 in September 1995.</p>
<p>A total of 86,757 vehicles were sold during the first nine months of 1996, 13.1 percent less than in January-September 1995, the survey said.</p>
<p>-- Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944</p>
